// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

#define Base     0
#define Macros   1
#define Sym      2
#define Numbers  3
#define Gaming   4
#define Qwerty   5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "hold-preferred";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        tdl: tap_dance_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&kp HOME>, <&tog Macros>, <&tog Sym>;
        };

        tdr: tap_dance_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&kp END>, <&caps_word>, <&tog Numbers>;
        };

        htdl: holdlayer_tapdance_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HTDL";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&tdl>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            hold-while-undecided;
        };

        htdr: holdlayer_tapdance_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HTDR";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&tdr>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            hold-while-undecided;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        lpar {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <13 14>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        rpar {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <15 16>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        lbracket {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_BRACKET>;
            key-positions = <3 4>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        rbracket {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_BRACKET>;
            key-positions = <5 6>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        lbrace {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_BRACE>;
            key-positions = <24 25>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        rbrace {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_BRACE>;
            key-positions = <26 27>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        question {
            bindings = <&kp QUESTION>;
            key-positions = <14 15>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        slash {
            bindings = <&kp SLASH>;
            key-positions = <33 36>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        macrolayer {
            bindings = <&mo Macros>;
            key-positions = <0 10>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        numberslayer {
            bindings = <&mo Numbers>;
            key-positions = <13 33>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        tempsymbolslayer {
            bindings = <&mo 2>;
            key-positions = <16 36>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        tobaselayer {
            bindings = <&to Base>;
            key-positions = <11 12 13>;
        };

        togamelayer {
            bindings = <&to Gaming>;
            key-positions = <35 36 37>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        tonumbersblayer {
            bindings = <&to Numbers>;
            key-positions = <16 17 18>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
                &kp B       &kp Y       &kp O        &kp U         &kp APOSTROPHE    &kp SEMICOLON  &kp L         &kp D        &kp W       &kp V
                &hm LGUI C  &hm LALT I  &hm LCTRL E  &hm LSHIFT A  &kp COMMA         &kp PERIOD     &hm RSHIFT H  &hm RCTRL T  &hm LALT S  &hm LGUI N
&htdl Macros 0  &kp G       &kp X       &kp J        &kp K         &kp Q             &kp Z          &kp R         &kp M        &kp F       &kp P       &htdr Sym 0
                                        &kp ESC      &kp BSPC      &kp DEL           &kp RET        &kp SPACE     &kp TAB
            >;
        };

        Macros {
            bindings = <
       &none  &kp LS(LG(LEFT))  &kp LS(LG(UP))    &kp LS(LG(RIGHT))  &none             &kp PRINTSCREEN  &kp HOME     &none         &kp END        &none
       &none  &kp LG(LEFT)      &kp LG(UP_ARROW)  &kp LG(RIGHT)      &kp LEFT_SHIFT    &none            &kp LEFT     &kp UP_ARROW  &kp RIGHT      &kp LEFT_CONTROL
&none  &none  &none             &kp LG(DOWN)      &none              &none             &none            &kp PAGE_UP  &kp DOWN      &kp PAGE_DOWN  &none             &none
                                &kp C_MUTE        &kp C_VOL_UP       &kp C_VOL_DN      &kp LC(SLASH)    &kp LA(TAB)  &kp LEFT_ALT
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Sym";
            bindings = <
           &kp EXCL   &kp AT         &kp HASH         &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT         &kp F1  &kp F2          &kp F3            &kp F4   &kp F5
           &kp MINUS  &kp PLUS       &kp UNDERSCORE   &kp SLASH   &kp BACKSLASH       &trans  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp F11  &kp F12
&kp GRAVE  &kp CARET  &kp AMPERSAND  &kp KP_ASTERISK  &kp EQUAL   &kp SINGLE_QUOTE    &kp F6  &kp F7          &kp F8            &kp F9   &kp F10  &trans
                                     &trans           &trans      &trans              &trans  &trans          &trans
            >;
        };

        Numbers {
            bindings = <
       &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &kp NUMBER_7  &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &none
       &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &kp KP_PLUS      &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5  &kp NUMBER_6  &kp KP_DIVIDE
&none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none    &kp KP_MINUS     &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp PIPE       &none
                     &none  &none  &none    &kp KP_DOT       &kp NUMBER_0  &kp KP_EQUAL
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            bindings = <
          &kp ESC    &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E      &kp R      &kp T   &kp Y   &kp U   &kp I  &kp O
          &kp LSHFT  &kp A  &kp S  &kp D      &kp F      &kp G   &kp H   &kp J   &kp K  &kp L
&kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C      &kp V      &kp B   &kp N   &kp M   &kp P  &kp BSPC  &kp ENTER
                            &kp M  &kp SPACE  &kp TAB    &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3
            >;
        };

        Qwerty {
            display-name = "Qwerty";
            bindings = <
        &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E   &kp R   &kp T     &kp Y   &kp U   &kp I      &kp O       &kp P
        &kp A  &kp S  &kp D   &kp F   &kp G     &kp H   &kp J   &kp K      &kp L       &kp SEMI
&trans  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C   &kp V   &kp B     &kp N   &kp M   &kp COMMA  &kp PERIOD  &kp SLASH  &trans
                      &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
